# AI instructions files — gardés en local seulement, jamais commit/push
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
**/GEMINI.md

# Markdown — only allow root README/CHANGELOG/SECURITY/LICENSE + docs/**
*.md
*.txt
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!SECURITY.md
!LICENSE
!docs/**/*.md
!docs/**/*.txt
!packages/*/README.md
# Skill bun écrit à la main (non restaurable via skills-lock) → committé
!.agents/skills/bun/SKILL.md

# Secrets — cookie jars, tokens (jamais commit)
.secrets/

# Artefacts reverse-engineering (dumps mémoire, décompilation, gros binaires)
/re/
/.secrets/
/.secrets/
re/refs/
